                "type": "text",
                "content": "A fraction can describe part of a group of things — a fraction of a collection of marbles, students, or mangoes. It works just like sharing them into equal groups. Quick words: numerator means the top number in a fraction showing how many parts you take. denominator means the bottom number in a fraction showing how many equal groups there are.",
